#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-training-audit.md:1
#: d1580675d4614b16b91bd11e30ebbba7
msgid "训练集评估（Training Set Audit）"
msgstr "Training Set Audit"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-training-audit.md:3
#: a3cbb781ed2646d9bacf2e7abbd5735e
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-training-audit.md:5
#: d484a5b67b1a4346bb0dd0f53fb784c8
msgid "把当前活动结构送入训练集评估页面，检查阻塞项、组分、标签、局域环境、结构相和磁类型。 这个入口不复制数据，也不会自动删除或修改结构。"
msgstr ""
"Send the currently active structures to Training Set Audit to inspect "
"blocking issues, composition, labels, local environments, structural "
"phases, and magnetic types. This entry point does not copy data and never"
" deletes or modifies structures automatically."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-training-audit.md:8
#: 191593af3576441e848322d19974a327
msgid "评估范围与结果"
msgstr "Scope and results"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8072
#: b1e62db01922423b8b91581e567c1f5f
msgid "位置：主图工具栏中 `删除选中项` 后面的分隔线右侧。"
msgstr "Location: right of the separator after `Delete selected items` on the plot toolbar."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8073
#: f6d75d44065d43cf9246e20ed75d3668
msgid "评估范围：当前活动结构；已经删除的结构不参与。"
msgstr "Scope: currently active structures; deleted structures are excluded."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8074
#: d5313773de1a4072af9d85148d8c5e00
msgid "概览：结构/原子统计、标签可用性、元素共现矩阵与精确元素集合。"
msgstr ""
"Overview: structure and atom statistics, label availability, the element "
"co-occurrence matrix, and exact element sets."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8075
#: 6bd355b1517a4650aea03f5b8fee35c5
msgid "证据：数据质量、局域化学、结构相和磁类型；耗时证据在后台计算。"
msgstr ""
"Evidence: data quality, local chemistry, structural phases, and magnetic "
"types; expensive evidence is computed in the background."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8076
#: f42f33acfcaf4d6bb61c9579a27cbed7
msgid "结构回选：点击图表、表格或复核项后，可把真实结构索引送回 `NEP 数据集查看`。"
msgstr ""
"Structure selection: clicking a chart, table, or review item sends the "
"actual structure indices back to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8077
#: 4bbb6283582147b2bf7d1584ed551c95
msgid "报告：`导出 HTML 报告` 保存本次评估范围、指纹、证据、判据和限制。"
msgstr ""
"Report: `Export HTML report` saves the audited scope, fingerprint, "
"evidence, criteria, and limitations."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8079
#: 7db8cbf6bb9b4cafa92252380f0835b8
msgid "完整操作顺序和识别原理见 [训练集评估](training-set-assessment.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Training Set Audit](training-set-assessment.md) for the complete "
"workflow and identification rules."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-training-audit.md:15
#: f464ef4919364eedaea55b4ce72e621f
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-training-audit.md:17
#: 64ad830953314c5abdccd7e4db704d25
msgid ""
"先看概览中的训练阻塞项，再进入数据地图和复核队列。点击图表或复核项可以把真实结构索引 回选到「NEP "
"数据集查看」页面；数据变化后应重新检查，不能继续使用旧快照。"
msgstr ""
"Review blocking issues on the Overview first, then continue to Data Map "
"and Review Queue. Clicking a chart or review item selects the "
"corresponding actual structure indices back in NEP Dataset Display. Rerun"
" the audit after the data changes; do not reuse a stale snapshot."

#~ msgid "位置：删除按钮后的分隔栏右侧。"
#~ msgstr "Location: to the right of the separator after the delete action."
